<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks fall to 54,548.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks fall to 54,548.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of Sept 23 totaled 54,548 bales, down slightly from 59,564 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were no bales issued, 5,280 decertification orders, 16 cancellations, and 1,690 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities Desk 212-859-1640</p>
